          "Share the amount and type of fluid recently added if known, together with the warning wording. Do not assume every warning can be solved by topping up. Ford’s [AdBlue information](https://www.ford.co.uk/support/how-tos/more-vehicle-topics/fuel-and-fuel-economy/how-to-top-up-adblue) is an example of manufacturer guidance; the instructions for your own vehicle take precedence."
