          "If travelling from [Tigbauan](/locations/tigbauan/) or [Guimbal](/locations/guimbal/), confirm the Autohex pin, service compatibility and vehicle condition before setting off. A longer journey should not be used as an improvised repair attempt. Ask whether the vehicle needs transport and whether the requested emissions-system assessment is currently available."
