          "The required work may involve more than one stage. A replacement controller can need compatibility checks and setup before the vehicle operates correctly. Ask whether the quoted scope includes the necessary configuration and verification. If the problem concerns the engine computer specifically, the [ECU repair page](/services/ecu-repair/) provides a more focused starting point."
