          "The [ECU remapping page](/services/ecu-remapping/) is relevant when a healthy, supported vehicle is being considered for a calibration change. It is not a substitute for [automotive diagnostics](/services/automotive-diagnostics/). Ask what checks are needed to establish a dependable starting condition before discussing performance goals, especially after previous modifications or a recent purchase."
