          "For increased fuel use, provide comparable records where possible: distance travelled, fuel added and changes in load or route. Different traffic and usage can change consumption without proving a mechanical failure. The purpose of the enquiry is to distinguish an actual change in vehicle condition from a change in operating circumstances."
